DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/collections/{collection_id}
Deletes a collection and all its items. This action cannot be undone. The Durable Object storage is deleted asynchronously.
Required: account_id (path) — Account ID; collection_id (path) — Collection UUID

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/collections/{collection_id}/columns/{column_id}
Delete a column from the collection schema. Data is preserved as orphaned UUID keys (forensic safety) and filtered from API responses.
Required: account_id (path); collection_id (path); column_id (path) — Column UUID

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/collections/{collection_id}/items/{item_id}
Delete an item from a collection by its identifier.
Required: account_id (path); collection_id (path); item_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/collections/{collection_id}
Retrieves a single collection by ID with its schema and metadata
Required: account_id (path) — Account ID; collection_id (path) — Collection UUID

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/collections/{collection_id}/items/{item_id}
Retrieve a single item from a collection by its identifier.
Required: account_id (path); collection_id (path); item_id (path)
